  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Writes share one registry",
      "items": [
        "propose and import-csv seal proposals; adoption alone changes suite standing. report records batches and results; claim appends reviews and findings; attach saves files.",
        "change records a change ending or reopening. announce records artifacts, builds and deployments. plan creates runs and slots. decide records an answer; only a counted answer settles a decision.",
        "HTTP, CLI and MCP dispatch through src/server/ops/index.ts. MCP exposes a subset of operations. Identity supplies actors, tokens, sessions and grants; permissions apply before input validation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "One SQLite file; six owning modules",
      "items": [
        "Suite: cases, versions, folders, proposals, placements, case_aliases, case_tags, requirements, covers and search_docs.",
        "Evidence: tests, targets, changes, batches, results, signatures, flips, findings, reviews, excuses, result_excuses, quarantines, artifacts, builds, deployments and attachments. Attachment bytes live in the blobs directory, addressed by hash.",
        "Runs: runs, slots, run_tests, slot_results and depends_on. Decisions: questions, question_refs, answers and the decisions ledger. Policy: policies stores versioned clauses. Identity: actors, tokens, sessions and grants, with credentials and teams."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "A cause becomes a question, then a decision",
      "items": [
        "Results with failures share signatures. Detectors group occurrences by cause and raise or reuse its question; an answer still in force can cover a later occurrence. Proposals, unmapped tests, findings and run signoff also raise questions.",
        "A person or permitted rule answers. The ledger row is written before a Witness reaches the effect. Only decision effects change standing: case heads, test links, excuses, run closure and policy. These effects refold affected runs.",
        "The server admits evidence to runs and slots, then src/core/runs.ts verdict computes pending, failed, blocked or passed from the tally, blockers, missing evidence and decisions in force. Agent reports do not move a commit gate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Consumers read the same record",
      "items": [
        "mainworthy gate exits 0 passed, 1 failed, 2 blocked or 3 pending. Configured statuses reread the current gate and deliver GitHub commit statuses.",
        "Committed project events at /api/p/:project/events invalidate web query keys and trigger refetch; reconnect refreshes the project. The iPhone app follows the same stream and refreshes its screens.",
        "Reports use stats to read evidence and suite data. Explicit tracker requests create or link defect issues through GitHub or Jira; a failure alone does not create an issue. Transfer exports eligible tables and blobs; audit exports the decision and evidence record."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
